xO(a,b,c){return"No single scale says it, but the tinted scales together do: "+c+". Put end to end, "+b+" outweighs "+a+", even though the exact weights stay unknown. So "+a+" can't be the heaviest: I rule it out."},
xN(a){return"Only "+a+" is left: it is the heaviest."},
Cy(a){return"The path starts from the number in the outlined cell, top left. Total: "+a+"."},
